{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/extras/c61155d7292e2e5071bd4011f2c8d24e.avif?t=1773696639\" width=64 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starfell</strong> is a story-driven indie game focused on atmosphere, narrative, and psychological tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the game presents itself as one built around choice and freedom. Dialogues shift, paths branch, and the player is encouraged to interact with the world. Beneath that surface, however, every path ultimately leads to the same conclusion. This loss of control is intentional \u2014 Starfell is not about shaping the story, but about slowly realizing that you never truly could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no traditional RPG progression. The game features no leveling system, no grinding, and no constant combat. Each chapter unfolds through exploration and dialogue, building toward a single, carefully designed boss encounter. Combat is rare, deliberate, and tightly tied to the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starfell blends visual novel\u2013style storytelling with light RPG influences, prioritizing mood, pacing, and psychological discomfort over action. The experience is designed to make the player question their role, their agency, and the meaning behind their decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/extras/3222e2206cf1cf5a7361a0c209f5907b.avif?t=1773696639\" width=64 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Story-focused experience with psychological themes<br>\u2022 Visual novel\u2013style progression with RPG influences<br>\u2022 An intentional illusion of choice \u2014 all paths converge<br>\u2022 No leveling system or repetitive combat<br>\u2022 One narrative-driven boss fight per chapter<br>\u2022 Strong emphasis on atmosphere and pacing<br>\u2022 Humor mixed with unease and subtle horror<br>\u2022 A single ending, experienced through different perspectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/extras/bf3e7a83ee8064f18c6b8a0f04dd30fc.avif?t=1773696639\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Starfell is made for players who enjoy slow-burning, unsettling narratives and games that challenge the idea of player control.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Contains mature themes and occasional strong language. (+16)</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/extras/b05497b0590fb28346b9e330b9606c58.poster.avif?t=1773696639\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/extras/b05497b0590fb28346b9e330b9606c58.webm?t=1773696639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/extras/b05497b0590fb28346b9e330b9606c58.mp4?t=1773696639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957870?t=1773696639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/bb74d488b6b4d250c5a6a2eac13108d2451f79cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773696639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/c00aea6945985d66801dbc082e47a058cc0f3830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773696639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957870/c00aea6945985d66801dbc082e47a058cc0